BindOS Structure Inspector
==========================

This repository is derived from sokrypton/py2Dmol at revision
78c2d489d0b5c5d19accd9eeeef878c2868f5271.
Source: https://github.com/sokrypton/py2Dmol

The original BEER-WARE notice is retained verbatim in LICENSE.  The BindOS
changes add a local-only immutable-mmCIF/inspection-manifest interface, typed
validation at the package boundary, semantic inspection layers, and hashed
HTML/JSON/SVG/PNG export.  Arbitrary PDB/AFDB fetching is not part of the new
public interface; the legacy py2Dmol module remains included for attribution
and renderer reuse.

Runtime dependencies inherited from the pinned upstream revision:

- NumPy: BSD-3-Clause.
- Biopython 1.88: Biopython License Agreement (permissive BSD-style).
- IPython: BSD-3-Clause.

The reusable package must be distributed with LICENSE and this NOTICE.
